{
  "slug": "agent-sdk-dev",
  "name": "Agent Sdk Dev",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Development kit for working with the Claude Agent SDK",
  "longDescription": "Includes 2 agents (agent-sdk-verifier-py, agent-sdk-verifier-ts) that validate SDK implementations by checking type correctness, imports, and package versions, plus a `/new-sdk-app` command that scaffolds new projects in Python or TypeScript with interactive prompts for agent type, complexity level, and tooling. Generates starter code, environment files, and optional .claude/ directory with agents and commands.",
